WEBVTT

00:40:56.982 --> 00:41:00.686
can make a huge difference already
in China, US and elsewhere.

00:41:01.061 --> 00:41:06.445
So whether the next professor
is open to sharing with the world,

00:41:06.469 --> 00:41:09.262
or forbidden from sharing
due to export control,

00:41:09.286 --> 00:41:12.622
I don't view that
as a big short-term issue.

00:41:13.103 --> 00:41:17.911
CA: OK, so let's talk now
about the possible downsides of AI

00:41:17.935 --> 00:41:19.721
to humanity generally.

00:41:19.745 --> 00:41:23.229
In the West, that argument
is often framed in terms of,

00:41:23.253 --> 00:41:26.353
"What happens when
general intelligence arrives,

00:41:26.377 --> 00:41:27.950
when super intelligence arrives,

00:41:27.974 --> 00:41:30.346
suddenly we discover
we've got these machines